cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Global Building Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A single-file web application that streams building footprints, heights and
  historical satellite imagery for anywhere on Earth. Each building can be queried for
  its measured footprint geometry, its exact count of physically touching neighbours,
  and estimated height, storeys and population share. Built as the delivered product
  of a study on segmenting individual buildings in dense informal settlements.
type: software
